                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Bitumenvoranstrich</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">  herstellen.</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;"/>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">- Kaltselbstklebende Elastomerbitumen-Unterlagsbahn mit</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Sicherheits-</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">  Schweißnaht, PYE-KTG KSP - 4,0, unterseitig</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">vollflächig selbstklebend,</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">  Zuschnitt 85 cm,</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">  liefern, auf die untere Lage der Dachabdichtung durch</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Abziehen der</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">  silikonisierten Folie  vollflächig aufkleben und</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">thermisch mit einem</span>
                </p>
