                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Durchmesser 100 mm,</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">einschließlich der verzinkten Rohrschellen und</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Rohrwulst,</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">100 mm ineinander gesteckt einbauen, dichtlöten und an</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">das</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
