                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Abstand der Rohrschellen bis Durchmesser 100 mm max.</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">3,0 m.</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
