                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">.......................................................</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">,</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">liefern, gemäß Herstellervorschrift über vorhandenen</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Anschlagpunkten zur Absturzsicherung,</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Fabrikat AMH Berlin, Bauart 7, Durchmesser 76 mm,</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">einbauen und an die Abdichtungsschicht anschließen.</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Der Schrumpfschlauch ist so lange zu erwärmen, bis das</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">Material dicht an dem einzudichtenden Gegenstand</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:14.0pt;">
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;Color:#000000;">anliegt.</span>
                </p>
