 </Award>
 <AddText>
  <DetailAddText>
   <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11.0pt;margin-left:0cm;margin-right:0cm;text-indent:0cm;">
    <span>Wir hoffen, Ihnen ein günstiges Angebot unterbreitet zu haben und würden uns freuen, Ihren Auftrag zu erhalten.</span>
   </p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11.0pt;margin-left:0cm;margin-right:0cm;text-indent:0cm;"/>
   <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11.0pt;margin-left:0cm;margin-right:0cm;text-indent:0cm;"/>
   <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11.0pt;margin-left:0cm;margin-right:0cm;text-indent:0cm;">
    <span>Mit freundlichen Grüßen</span>
   </p>
   <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11.0pt;margin-left:0cm;margin-right:0cm;text-indent:0cm;"/>
   <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11.0pt;margin-left:0cm;margin-right:0cm;text-indent:0cm;">
    <span>HAGMANS GMBH</span>
   </p>
